      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Creatures killed by the false governor are difficult to bring back to life or to animate as undead. The false governor automatically attempts to counteract|CRB|3|counteracting|0 any attempt to resurrect or animate as undead any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier +26, counteract level 7th). If the false governor is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally."
